This is an independent extension for Jitsi Meet. It is not an official
Jitsi release and is not endorsed by the upstream projects.

Jitsi Meet
Source: https://github.com/jitsi/jitsi-meet/tree/stable/jitsi-meet_11248
License: Apache License, Version 2.0

Jitsi Opus Transcriber Proxy
Source: https://github.com/jitsi/opus-transcriber-proxy/tree/ee5836e67806349395ede2447376003da893f7a9
License: Apache License, Version 2.0

Upstream programs are installed separately. The adapter in
ops/patch-opus-proxy.py describes changes applied to the pinned proxy.
Preserve upstream copyright, license and notice files in those installations.

No generated Windows speech audio, API credentials, meeting recordings,
or private deployment state is included in this repository.
